# Apps

::summary
The Apps surface in the shell wrapper: ruled 880px centered column, title row with the app count and icon-only ＋ / Sort actions (G3), rows ⇄ grid segmented-control, iOS AppRow rows (name, description, neutral provider + status chips). The inline sort row is gone (WP-N3, docs G4 precedent): sort lives in `modals/filter.surf` (Apps vocabulary), opened from the Sort button. The New App sheet is `modals/create.surf` (App kind) — no inline copy. The apps glyph is the canonical crossed hammer + wrench everywhere.
::

