## Sort sheet

Defined ONCE in `modals/filter.surf` (`name=filter`, anchored to the title-row Sort button): one sheet, per-surface vocabulary — here the single Apps sort dropdown (Latest first / Name, `applySort` unchanged). The Sort button opens it via `toggleSortRow`; this file carries no inline copy.

## New App sheet

Defined ONCE in `modals/create.surf` (`name=create`, App kind: describe → Generate prefills the Surfy panel, opens it if closed, never auto-sends; no manual path — apps are built by Surfy). The title-row ＋ opens it via `openCreateApp`; this file carries no inline copy.
